    "name": "What Affects the Cost of a Kitchen Layout Redesign in San Diego County?",
    "text": "What Affects the Cost of a Kitchen Layout Redesign in San Diego County?",
    "@type": "Question",
    "answerCount": 1,
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "text": "The right kitchen layout redesign depends on the room’s existing conditions, the desired storage and work areas, appliance locations, structural constraints, and the amount of plumbing, gas, electrical, or wall work involved. Keeping major utilities near their current locations can limit construction complexity, while a new island, relocated sink, removed wall, or expanded footprint may require more detailed planning and permitting.",
